#: {{ux|en|All names were placed into an '''alphabetical''' list.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[literal]]
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1644|author=w:John Milton|title=The Doctrine & Discipline of Divorce|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=6oI-AQAAMAAJ&pg=PA31|page=31|passage=But if an '''alphabeticall''' servility must be still urged, it may so fall out,}}

